2. **Elimination of the 5-Building Runaround:**
   * A single digital clearance submission replaces 4 days of walking between Library, Hostel Warden, Accounts, and Registrar.
3. **Physical-to-Digital Mobile Bridge:**
   * Students leave the lobby kiosk with a printed or downloadable PDF token slip featuring a live QR code, allowing them to track real-time clearance progression from their smartphone.
4. **24/7 Access to Official Forms:**
